== story
At night on an empty industrial boulevard, Mara grips the wheel of a modified red coupe beside Jace in a modified silver hatchback. Between their cars, a starter in a white jacket raises one hand. Streetlights gleam across the pavement as the engines climb into a rough, impatient roar. The starter counts down, “three, two, one, go,” drops his hand, and steps back as both cars launch from the line. Tires shriek; the coupe briefly loses traction while the hatchback surges ahead. Through his open window, Jace shouts toward Mara, “Keep up!” Mara steadies the red car, pulls alongside him, and shouts back, “Not tonight!” Their voices cut through the engines as the cars charge between the dark warehouses, nearly level. With the finish stripe approaching, Mara edges ahead by half a hood. The tense, defiant sprint ends as her red coupe crosses the finish first.
